Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Denis Merville?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 64, "text": "**French Politician Denis Merville Roots for the Common Farmer**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 66, "end": 312, "text": "In a surprising revelation, French politician Denis Merville has come forward to disclose his lesser-known profession as an \"agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation\" – a category of farmers who manage medium-sized agricultural operations in France."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 313, "end": 482, "text": "This unexpected admission has sent ripples through the political landscape, with many praising Merville's commitment to understanding the struggles of the common farmer."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 483, "end": 596, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Merville explained his decision to share this aspect of his life."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 597, "end": 679, "text": "\"As a politician, I've always believed in staying connected to the people I serve."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 680, "end": 843, "text": "My work as an agriculteur sur moyenne exploitation allows me to stay grounded and appreciate the challenges faced by our nation's agricultural community,\" he said."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 844, "end": 970, "text": "Merville's farm, located in the picturesque countryside of Normandy, spans over 100 hectares and employs a team of 15 workers."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 971, "end": 1152, "text": "According to data from the French National Institute for Agricultural Research (INRA), medium-sized farms like Merville's account for nearly 40% of France's agricultural production."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1153, "end": 1271, "text": "We spoke to several of Merville's colleagues in the agricultural sector, who praised his dedication to the profession."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1272, "end": 1443, "text": "\"Denis is not just a politician who talks about farming; he's a farmer who happens to be a politician,\" said Pierre Dupont, president of the Normandy Farmers' Association."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1444, "end": 1541, "text": "\"He understands the intricacies of our trade and has always been willing to lend a helping hand.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1542, "end": 1609, "text": "Merville's dual role has also led to innovative policy initiatives."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1610, "end": 1803, "text": "His proposed \"Farm-to-Table\" program, which aims to increase the market share of locally sourced produce in French supermarkets, has garnered widespread support from both farmers and consumers."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1804, "end": 1971, "text": "When asked about the challenges of balancing his political and agricultural responsibilities, Merville chuckled, \"It's not always easy, but I've learned to prioritize."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1972, "end": 2045, "text": "During harvest season, you can find me in the fields from dawn till dusk."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2046, "end": 2141, "text": "The rest of the year, I'm in the National Assembly, fighting for the rights of French farmers.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2142, "end": 2360, "text": "As the agricultural sector continues to face uncertainty in the wake of climate change and trade agreements, Merville's unique perspective is expected to play a significant role in shaping France's agricultural policy."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2361, "end": 2466, "text": "His commitment to the land and its people has earned him a reputation as a champion of the common farmer."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2467, "end": 2559, "text": "In the words of Merville himself, \"Agriculture is not just a profession; it's a way of life."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 55, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Pensioner: Denis Merville's Journey"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 57, "end": 156, "text": "In the quaint town of Lyon, France, a peculiar sight could be seen strolling along the Rhône River."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 157, "end": 300, "text": "Denis Merville, a seasoned French politician, had traded in his suit and tie for a more relaxed attire, often donning a beret and a warm smile."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 301, "end": 421, "text": "At first glance, it seemed as though he had abandoned his life of public service, but the truth was far more intriguing."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 422, "end": 523, "text": "Denis Merville, the man who had spent decades shaping the country's policies, had become a pensioner."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 524, "end": 630, "text": "The evidence of this unexpected transformation lay in the subtle yet telling details of his daily routine."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 631, "end": 775, "text": "Every morning, Denis would rise early, not to prepare for a day of parliamentary debates, but to collect his pension from the local post office."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 776, "end": 895, "text": "He would arrive at the designated hour, exchange pleasantries with the postal clerk, and receive his monthly allowance."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 896, "end": 987, "text": "This ritual, once a mundane task for many, had become a cherished part of Denis's new life."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 988, "end": 1112, "text": "As he walked back to his cozy apartment, the weight of his years of service was evident in the deliberate pace of his steps."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1113, "end": 1274, "text": "His eyes, once fixed on the horizon of France's future, now sparkled with a sense of contentment, a sense of finally being able to reap the rewards of his labor."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1275, "end": 1412, "text": "The pension, a symbol of his dedication to the nation, had become his lifeline, allowing him to live comfortably and pursue his passions."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1556, "text": "Denis's days were now filled with leisurely activities, a far cry from the high-stakes negotiations and late-night policy meetings of his past."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1557, "end": 1668, "text": "He would spend hours in his garden, tending to his prized roses, or sit by the river, watching the world go by."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1669, "end": 1818, "text": "The pension had given him the freedom to rediscover himself, to explore the simple joys of life that had been sacrificed on the altar of public duty."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1819, "end": 1991, "text": "One afternoon, as Denis sat at a sidewalk café, sipping a cup of coffee and reading the newspaper, a group of young politicians walked by, recognizing the former statesman."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1992, "end": 2105, "text": "They approached him, seeking advice and wisdom, and Denis, happy to oblige, shared stories of his time in office."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2106, "end": 2241, "text": "As they departed, he couldn't help but feel a sense of pride, knowing that his legacy continued to inspire a new generation of leaders."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2242, "end": 2373, "text": "The pension, once a mere financial safety net, had become a badge of honor, a testament to Denis's years of service and dedication."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Denis Merville", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "French politician Denis Merville has come forward to disclose his lesser-known profession as an \"agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation\".", "answer": "agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation", "quote": "In a surprising revelation, French politician Denis Merville has come forward to disclose his lesser-known profession as an \"agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation\" – a category of farmers who manage medium-sized agricultural operations in France.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Denis Merville", "scope": "occupation", "claim": "Denis Merville is a seasoned French politician.", "answer": "French politician", "quote": "Denis Merville, a seasoned French politician, had traded in his suit and tie for a more relaxed attire, often donning a beret and a warm smile.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["French politician", "agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation", "farmer", "pensioner"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "French politician", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "farmer", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "pensioner", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}

